#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/edit-structure-metadata.md:1
#: 7e45a9835d984c418b018390e1e3e418
msgid "批量整理结构元数据"
msgstr "Edit Structure Metadata in Batches"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/edit-structure-metadata.md:3
#: 14f0335b4832463ea871ba706cc531f4
msgid ""
"`Config_type` 和自定义标签常用于记录数据来源、计算阶段或复核状态。需要批量修"
"正时，先选中目标结构，再使用 `Edit info`，不要为了改几个标签重新拆分和合并文"
"件。"
msgstr ""
"`Config_type` and custom tags commonly record data provenance, calculation "
"stage, or review status. To change them in bulk, select the target "
"structures and use `Edit info`; there is no need to split and merge files "
"just to change a few tags."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/edit-structure-metadata.md:5
#: a9564c7ef83e41dabfe8224178461438
