#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/edit-structure-metadata.md:21
#: 87ad893622bc4038949425d7c89b3a89
msgid ""
"可以直接增加 `review_status=checked` 这类追踪标签。若要替换 `Config_type`，先"
"删除旧的 `Config_type`，再增加新的值，例如 `Config_type=reviewed_bulk`。确认"
"后，同一组修改会应用到所有选中结构。"
msgstr ""
"You can directly add a tracking tag such as `review_status=checked`. To "
"replace `Config_type`, remove the old `Config_type` first and then add the "
"new value, for example `Config_type=reviewed_bulk`. The same edits are "
"applied to every selected structure when you confirm."

